	SNA CLA
	JMP SECRET	/ASSUME STANDARD FEATURES
CHKLOG,	TAD (100	/"A@" (KEEP SIN & COS)
	JMS LOOKUP
	SZA CLA
	JMP CHKSIN
	JMS CHANGE	/KILL ALL EXTENDED FUNCTIONS
